WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.040
Think social media does not sell homes?

00:02.040 --> 00:02.960
Think again.

00:02.960 --> 00:05.440
Today's buyers don't just drive by, they scroll.

00:06.320 --> 00:07.800
That's where I capture attention

00:07.800 --> 00:10.120
and convert it into showings and offers.

00:10.120 --> 00:12.040
Each listing follows a plan.

00:12.040 --> 00:16.400
Pre-listing media, active outreach, and sold celebration.

00:16.400 --> 00:18.720
Social media helps me sell homes faster

00:18.720 --> 00:20.400
and connect to the out of town buyers.

00:20.400 --> 00:22.560
More visibility equals more value

00:22.560 --> 00:24.480
and that's exactly what I deliver.

